cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt the AISI Model, please cite it as below."
title: "AISI Model: Artificial Intelligence System Interconnection Model"
version: "2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jasonmichaelrobbins-arch/AISI_Model"
authors:
  - family-names: Robbins
    given-names: Jason
abstract: >-
  A seven-layer reference architecture for AI systems that call other agents,
  Model Context Protocol servers and tools: four internal layers, three exposed
  layers, cross-cutting governance and a signed audit trail, a six-phase trust
  sequence, and a baseline of 45 controls with owners and priorities. Published
  as a core document and six companions (Quick Start Guide, A2A Protocol
  Specification, Baseline Controls, Security Reference, Implementation Guide,
  Operations and Lifecycle Reference).
keywords:
  - AI security
  - agent security
  - reference architecture
  - Model Context Protocol
  - A2A
  - governance
